    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll definitely look into the belt. it's just so weird though, like you said, it's so fleeting. i've been trying to catch it on video with my phone, but i can never seem to time it right. it's almost like it hears me coming or knows i'm looking for it, and then it just hides. it's such a tiny, elusive little thing. do you think it could be something really small, like a tiny piece of debris or something loose that's just rattling around and then settling into place?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
