    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah, it's probably just a bracket or something. but man, it's just so unnerving. the way it's so intermittent is what's getting to me. it's not like a regular broken part that just makes a constant noise—it's like it's playing hide and seek. it feels so... I don't know, mischievous? like there's some tiny, unseen presence in there just waiting for the right moment to make a noise and then instantly retreating. do mechanics ever have cases where it seems like the car is just being temperamental or doing things on purpose just to be annoying?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
